# EXCEPTION: the frozen evidence package sent to independent methodological
# review. It must be tracked so "which version did the reviewer see" has an
# exact answer -- a claim that it is reproducible is not the same as a
# recorded correspondence between the circulated file and a commit.
# Regenerate it with build_sensitivity_review_packet.py; never edit by hand.
!reports/manuscript/revision/sensitivity_design_review/sensitivity_design_review_packet.pdf
# ...but never its build intermediates. They are regenerated on every build and
# were once swept in by a `git add -A` that ran while they happened to exist.
